# ── Payload files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# functions/medium/payload.bin and functions/heavy/payload.bin are generated by
# `make gen-payloads` (50 MB and 200 MB synthetic blobs respectively).
# They are intentionally excluded from git — commit them and the repo becomes
# hundreds of megabytes.
#
# After a fresh clone, run `make gen-stubs` to create 1-byte placeholder files
# required by the //go:embed payload.bin directives so the code compiles.
# Run `make gen-payloads` before benchmarking to replace the stubs with
# real-sized payloads.
functions/medium/payload.bin
functions/heavy/payload.bin

# Standard Go build artifacts
*.exe
*.test
coverage.out
coverage.html
bin/
